self.KB_CONTENT["card:792616"]={"id":"card:792616","ty":"card","sourceId":"792616","title":"『製令成本建立作業』中的『生產入庫 (TA012)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"製令","keywords":["製令","生產","入庫","實際"],"y":"other","answer":"* 本期實際生產入庫數量，執行成本計算後由系統自動計算，無法修改。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:792762"]={"id":"card:792762","ty":"card","sourceId":"792762","title":"『商品包裝資料建立作業』中的『寬(CM) (MC014)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"大於","keywords":["大於","包裝","商品","等於"],"y":"other","answer":"* 此欄位必須大於等於零。* 材積=長×寬×高×0.032808^3。=長×寬×高×(0.032808×0.032808×0.032808)。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
